  {
   "kind": "anchor_block_text_image-94240",
   "id": "anchor_block_text_image-94240",
   "title": "Oceanis 30.1 Electric",
   "intro": "Silent, comfortable and emission free, the new Oceanis 30.1e now has an all-electric propulsion system. With engine power equals to 14 HP, the Torqeedo engine has a range of up to 6 hours at 4 knots.\nThis procures new sensations and offers a unique boating experience.",
